{"job_id":"F-9c95bcf695ea36637bdf","family_id":"F-9c95bcf695ea36637bdf","title":"육군학생군사학교령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":9,"target_id":"72d34817f4241d4e0649d931f8d31a6e461884a69e89c7995a955bd68915ac77","source_hash":"a6b303645ad449db22bdffe280c137c32769841ada80ca8fb15f1a743c1b6754","text":"陆军学生军事学校规章"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":259,"target_id":"cd03874d13a6760bfd8f66c688e7ebe69015b41c708418e8b6a494ff8c121769","source_hash":"249ebc072cb4875886c34da2c80928a3eb9a621771ae61b7d5ca39d15d78b91d","text":"第一条（设施和任务）\n①陆军学生军事学校（以下简称“学校”）将在陆军内部设立。<2012年2月22日修订>\n② 该校应按照下列各款规定，在陆军管辖范围内开展教育，并制定为此目的所必需的理论。<2012年2月22日修订，2018年8月28日修订>\n1. 根据《军事人员法》第二条第二款，对军官候选人和准尉候选人进行入伍训练\n2. 根据《兵役法》第58条第4款规定，应征入伍成为现役军官人员的入伍​​教育\n3. 删除<2018.8.28>\n4. 删除<2018.8.28>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":259,"end":474,"target_id":"2c190a163704e5b066d46c23ea4ca3bdb80d86a4fd6cf6711858088c6039ebc6","source_hash":"b0e769fac53161fc25c3c28e1a876de02deaf46c993be599c6f569804a8fb41d","text":"第二条（主要）\n① 每所学校应任命一名校长。<2012年2月22日修订，2018年8月28日修订>\n② 学校校长应由陆军将领担任。<1992年8月13日修订，2017年9月5日更新>\n③ 校长应在陆军参谋长的指挥下负责学术事务，并指挥和监督附属部门和单位。<2012年2月22日修订>\n④ 删除 <2018.8.28>\n⑤ 删除 <2018.8.28>\n⑥ 删除 <2018.8.28>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":474,"end":592,"target_id":"dc2c44693bffe0f5aff5fba102c91f417be4fbe010e774bf11aaf8be8932975f","source_hash":"6da4db796eab4a85cfc9feba6a41ae47d858d134080c52d092594b22ebd52a88","text":"第三条（部门和单位的设立）\n①建立学校所需的部门和单位。\n② 第1款所述部门的设立和职责划分事宜由陆军参谋长决定，部队的设立、任务和组织事宜由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":592,"end":612,"target_id":"87591db69af611e949c945523f4d9706e236d30db0ca634ffebdd4c9e2d88c57","source_hash":"f4d937e1421c1f972a16d6ee71cd1ff36405ef12d53c075be3f064ea9ee136fe","text":"删除第 4 条 <2018.8.28>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":612,"end":720,"target_id":"3faec7e8cfd6a31746c4131ae56afdd93c96cb6b3a84d91ef1cc7eb7d3c9ed16","source_hash":"97150bd2917f9e4b2789ccaa44ceb59fbbc273866b3c811adb837c293d2b8220","text":"第五条（在其他单位进行教育）如果某些教育科目和内容不适合在学校设施内实施，校长可以经陆军参谋长批准在其他单位进行此类教育。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":720,"end":840,"target_id":"a93b22ac1083e11364e6cc382577729b0a8384a98dbfde30461942c7958eb052","source_hash":"7146b0e0bf5e29168135a87d188f44556869edbd5d92d36d91bc8809fd3272db","text":"第六条（海军和空军受教育人员的教育实施）  根据海军或空军参谋长的请求，陆军参谋长经国防部长批准，可以安排在海军或空军受教育人员学校进行教育。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":840,"end":884,"target_id":"cc806a79d2c3b2914c41fc0127df40d969842852fe54314439a76763f0afe683","source_hash":"5f9f36cfc83ffcae9e3ab1f6ff80b0190c294b3608c1c3a8e170e368f3038b7a","text":"第七条（人员配额）军事人员和文职军事人员应分配到学校任教，人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":884,"end":1039,"target_id":"acf54c5e91228378615dd5f703c2c2f332f7d5fbacf21bed6345fe314a183768","source_hash":"f7855f4f56f35ae84da1be3011a109f25da78740a098733a982116ced91cca27","text":"补充条款 <第11782号，1985年10月28日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n②（修改其他法律）《军事人员法实施令》修改如下。\n\n  第十三条第一款第二项（b）项中的“以及陆军总务学校校长”应改为“陆军总务学校校长兼陆军中央军校学生校长”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1039,"end":1072,"target_id":"d1c715b26a9f8640d482d3fc6ec405c1351d1f0facb03e0e03df0f974f0d7400","source_hash":"c72121d5f653513c190fe5e5610dea0327c927771a442a2549941f8ab3f0544f","text":"补充条例（《军事人员法》实施令）<1992年8月13日第13708号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1072,"end":1102,"target_id":"6e2b5b875792749462fcdda383e12a4f98d06f1b8ec113877fbc9c87f96d36f9","source_hash":"40ac608cf2787f4f50a97c8b940ad8db5f2f59c445aea0216bf6cbd54d933b82","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1102,"end":1214,"target_id":"d2e4408c4556cff98beabb9b24665d85466d4f2818ae0784dbb1af91b93988fd","source_hash":"d2f61f7405490a818ba11171f3df79abd186764756b3fd6613ada2b1a2f8686a","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①至④ 省略\n\n  ⑤ 关于陆军学生中央军事学校的法令修改如下。\n\n  第二条第二款如下。\n\n  ②校长应被任命为陆军将领。\n\n  ⑥ 到 ⑨ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1214,"end":1258,"target_id":"4d4bcd6b2b2e09fc4f7d6baafe374844c5e11c2cf50c581aa40accd30ebc3311","source_hash":"9f84ad28106e5e4e37b4c958ea2bab64c2dcf1a206ad2dabf0f19bf0db5344da","text":"补充规定 <第23624号，2012年2月22日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1258,"end":1291,"target_id":"48cae29c5adc87dd17a0a54c58db2ad0b4fc444de00c550b23f4ad6b6a286aad","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充规定（《军事人员法》实施令）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1291,"end":1328,"target_id":"81b26da3466b9297f7c8d96ab5a1eee69aa30d21322fda770bd24e88a2b77c5c","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1328,"end":1342,"target_id":"ce1ac3fc98df79a5126619793c18f54bbf1d5fa2b91b216436cc1798e43a3dcc","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"省略第2条和第3条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1342,"end":1493,"target_id":"3dab88230bf7c0e387d77c0f937a8e1a86803ff5a724f2863b33339369d8d49f","source_hash":"d10d41694502bd867aee9ed2a1738a44c08d86b67180b715e2cd127801ee5dd1","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<70>款省略\n\n  <71> 陆军学生军事学校规章部分修订如下。\n\n  在第二条第二款中，“部级”应改为“一般级”，在同一条第四款中，“部级”应改为“一般级”。\n\n  <72> 至 <90> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004453-204290-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1493,"end":1535,"target_id":"458ad3ae1eb9502833f5b06d6143e2b987a03dce4f8bdc4691653c032417f683","source_hash":"95b13763d9d93d9b81910443328dcee3e104c190e60f84a9e6b70dea4133a04c","text":"补充规定 <第29119号，2018年8月28日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。"}]}